# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local dev.
# Required — enables chat + benchmark runs (they call the Anthropic API):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Optional — when set, /api/* requires this value in the x-usai-key header.
# Strongly recommended in production: chat and runs spend your tokens.
# ACCESS_TOKEN=choose-a-shared-secret
